 ['life_change','Make ONE explicitly requested change to the connected user’s planner. Read current record and module version first. Use only operations returned by overview. task.save needs listId and title for new tasks; goal.save uses type quarter/month/week, period and title. Merge updates preserves unspecified fields. Must use a new requestId per intended change; reuse for retries. On 409 re-read, do not overwrite blindly. Never send email, approve outreach, change permissions, permanently delete or fabricate statuses.',['module'=>['type'=>'string','enum'=>array_keys(self::OPERATIONS)],'operation'=>$str('Exact allowed operation from overview.'),'version'=>['type'=>'integer','minimum'=>1],'arguments'=>['type'=>'object','additionalProperties'=>true],'requestId'=>$str('Unique 8–100 character retry key.'),'instruction'=>$str('The current user instruction authorizing this change.')],['module','operation','version','arguments','requestId','instruction'],false]];
